{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UzDRAXNsHFjJjJC8CLLD6L","type":"tool_result","content":"17:## Updating images — imagePullPolicy\n20:Default imagePullPolicy: if you omit imagePullPolicy and specify a digest — IfNotPresent; if the tag is :latest — Always; if no tag is specified — Always; if a tag other than :latest is specified — IfNotPresent. Once a Pod is created, imagePullPolicy is not updated if the image's tag or digest changes later.\n22:## ImagePullBackOff\n23:[Omitted long matching line]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f4e90d3-770b-4003-9277-b785773091db","uuid":"2adf5d79-b1ee-4e99-9623-dbc151b9a10c","timestamp":"2026-08-24T10:23:54.889Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"17:## Updating images — imagePullPolicy\n20:Default imagePullPolicy: if you omit imagePullPolicy and specify a digest — IfNotPresent; if the tag is :latest — Always; if no tag is specified — Always; if a tag other than :latest is specified — IfNotPresent. Once a Pod is created, imagePullPolicy is not updated if the image's tag or digest changes later.\n22:## ImagePullBackOff\n23:[Omitted long matching line]","numLines":4,"totalLines":4}}
