{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" manage in Kubernetes.\n\nA *Pod* (as in a pod of whales or pea pod) is a group of one or more containers, with shared storage and network resources, and a specification for how to run the"}},"session_id":"2f4e90d3-770b-4003-9277-b785773091db","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"86204526-0906-48c3-bbfd-ea422f2721ff"}
