{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":".\n\n## Understanding init containers\n\nA Pod can have multiple containers running apps within it, but it can also have one or more init containers, which are run before the app containers are started.\n\nInit containers are exactly like regular containers, except:\n\n* Init containers always run to"}},"session_id":"2f4e90d3-770b-4003-9277-b785773091db","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"8a6d7639-fcb8-46a4-9939-0c581acf8419"}
