{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"ority Pods that can be preempted from the Node. They may not acquire resources beyond their specified limits.\n\n### Criteria\n\nFor a Pod to be given a QoS class of `Guaranteed`:\n\n* Every Container in the Pod must have a memory limit and a"}},"session_id":"2f4e90d3-770b-4003-9277-b785773091db","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"c2a5e6b4-6de5-4b01-a608-06018ed221f1"}
{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" memory request, both greater than zero.\n* For every Container in the Pod, the memory limit must equal the memory request.\n* Every Container in the Pod must have a CPU limit and a CPU request, both greater than zero.\n* For every Container in the Pod, the CPU limit must equal the CP"}},"session_id":"2f4e90d3-770b-4003-9277-b785773091db","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"8fc9e10c-6485-40d5-9252-ac6c38343bf6"}
